
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Websites &amp; more</span>
        <h1>Websites, Google, dashboards <em>and custom tools.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Our main work is <a class="inline-link" href="ai-for-business">AI systems that improve business processes</a>. Alongside it we build the things a business needs to be found and to see its numbers, each at a fixed price.</p>
        <div class="btn-row page-head__cta">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="start">Get a website estimate</a>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--free" data-mockup-open>Free mockup <span class="btn__tag">Free</span></button>
        </div>
        <nav class="service-nav" aria-label="Jump to a service" style="justify-content:flex-start">
          <a href="#websites">Websites · from R12,500</a>
          <a href="#dashboards">Dashboards · from R15,000</a>
          <a href="#software">Custom Software · from R45,000</a>
          <a href="#ai">AI &amp; automation →</a>
        </nav>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1rem">Websites for your industry: <a class="inline-link" href="for-salons">salons</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-plumbers">plumbers &amp; trades</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-restaurants">restaurants</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-cleaners">cleaning services</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PILLAR: GET FOUND. -->
    <section class="pillar" id="get-found" aria-labelledby="getFoundTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow center reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Get found</span>
        <h2 id="getFoundTitle">Get found.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Be there when a customer goes looking for you: a website that works properly on a phone, and a Google profile that puts you on the map.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WEBSITES -->
    <section class="service" id="websites" aria-labelledby="websitesTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg></span>
          <h2 id="websitesTitle">Websites</h2>
          <p class="lead">Fast, professional websites built around what you want visitors to do — call, WhatsApp, book or buy.</p>
          <ul class="price-list" style="margin:0.8rem 0 0.4rem">
            <li><div class="pl-name">Business Website<small>Custom design, up to 8 pages, content and SEO set-up · ~2–3 weeks</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R12,500</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Platform or Web App<small>Bookings, payments, client portals, accounts, integrations</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R35,000</span></li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Examples</h3>
          <ul class="examples">
            <li>Business websites</li><li>Landing pages</li><li>Portfolio websites</li><li>Service websites</li><li>Restaurant websites</li><li>Booking websites</li><li>Ecommerce</li><li>Website integrations</li><li>Redesigns</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Your site has to do a job: win enquiries, take bookings or serve clients.</li>
            <li>Your current site is slow, dated or hard to update.</li>
            <li>You want enquiries by inbox or WhatsApp, not a dead "contact us" page.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.9rem">Changes to an existing site at R1,250 an hour, quoted first.</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="service__aside reveal">
          <div class="card">
            <h4>Starting price</h4>
            <span class="price"><small>From</small>R12,500</span>
            <p class="small muted">Target timeframes once content is supplied, not guaranteed dates.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card card--tint"><h4>See it live</h4><p>Try the <a class="inline-link" href="demos#booking">booking</a> and <a class="inline-link" href="demos#quote-calculator">quote</a> demos — the kind of thing a site can include.</p></div>
          <a href="start?type=Website" class="btn btn--primary btn--full">Start a website project</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PILLAR: SEE AND RUN -->
    <section class="pillar" id="work-smarter" aria-labelledby="workSmarterTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow center reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">See and run the business</span>
        <h2 id="workSmarterTitle">Dashboards and custom tools.</h2>
        <p class="lead">One screen for the numbers that matter, and the calculators, trackers and portals off-the-shelf software doesn&rsquo;t quite do.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="service" id="dashboards" aria-labelledby="dashboardsTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="12" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="12" y="8" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="17" y="5" width="3" height="13"/></svg></span>
          <h2 id="dashboardsTitle">Dashboards</h2>
          <p class="lead">Your spreadsheets and systems, turned into one screen you can actually read.</p>
          <h3>Examples</h3>
          <ul class="examples">
            <li>Business dashboards</li><li>Sales dashboards</li><li>Financial dashboards</li><li>Project dashboards</li><li>Reporting dashboards</li><li>Excel / CSV dashboards</li><li>Management dashboards</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Someone rebuilds the same report every week or month.</li>
            <li>Your data lives across spreadsheets that never quite agree.</li>
            <li>You want to see how the business is doing at a glance.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <aside class="service__aside reveal">
          <div class="card"><h4>Starting price</h4><span class="price"><small>From</small>R15,000</span><p class="small muted">Your key numbers from your main systems. More sources, and data that needs cleaning, add to the price.</p></div>
          <div class="card card--tint"><h4>Bring your data</h4><p>Excel, CSV or an export is enough to start. You can attach a sample file in the Project Builder.</p></div>
          <a href="start?type=Dashboard" class="btn btn--primary btn--full">Start a dashboard project</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CUSTOM SOFTWARE -->
    <section class="service section--tint" id="software" aria-labelledby="softwareTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6l-6 6 6 6"/><path d="M16 6l6 6-6 6"/><path d="M14 4l-4 16"/></svg></span>
          <h2 id="softwareTitle">Custom Software</h2>
          <p class="lead">When off-the-shelf doesn't fit, we build the tool that works your way — nothing you don't need.</p>
          <h3>Examples</h3>
          <ul class="examples">
            <li>Calculators</li><li>Quote generators</li><li>Booking systems</li><li>Customer trackers</li><li>Job management</li><li>Stock management</li><li>CRM-style systems</li><li>Client portals</li><li>Internal tools</li><li>Custom web apps</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>You pay for software that does only part of what you need.</li>
            <li>You have an idea for an app but don't know where to start.</li>
            <li>The business has outgrown Excel, WhatsApp and paper.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <aside class="service__aside reveal">
          <div class="card"><h4>Starting price</h4><span class="price"><small>From</small>R45,000</span><p class="small muted">Focused tools start here; larger applications are quoted after discovery.</p></div>
          <div class="card card--tint"><h4>Start small</h4><p>We build the smallest useful version first, then grow it in quoted steps as it proves itself.</p></div>
          <a href="start?type=Custom%20Software" class="btn btn--primary btn--full">Start a software project</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AI & AUTOMATION: now the main offer -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="ai" aria-labelledby="aiTitle">
      <div class="container band" id="automation">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">AI &amp; automation</span>
          <h2 id="aiTitle">Automating a process? That&rsquo;s our main work.</h2>
          <p class="lead">Enquiry handling, document capture, data entry between systems, reporting and staff knowledge bases run through our method: discovery, a proof of concept, production and monthly operations, measured before and after.</p>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="ai-for-business">See the solutions</a>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="pricing#implementation">Implementation pricing</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--dark" aria-labelledby="unsureTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow center reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Not sure which one you need?</span>
        <h2 id="unsureTitle">You don't have to pick a category.</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin:1rem auto 1.6rem">Describe the problem in the Project Builder and we’ll work out the simplest solution. If it turns out to be a process worth automating, we’ll suggest a process review instead.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a href="start" class="btn btn--light btn--large">Start a Project</a>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--free btn--large" data-mockup-open>Get a mockup <span class="btn__tag">Free</span></button>
        </div>
        <p class="small" style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--text-muted)">Not ready to commit? The mockup costs nothing — no deposit, no obligation. <a class="inline-link" href="demos">Try the demos →</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

